practiceProblems.description:
A developer wrote a `Book` constructor where parameters match fields, but forgot `this`:

```java
class Book {
    String title;
    Book(String title) {
        title = title; // Bug: title stays null!
    }
}
```

Fix the constructor using `this.title = title;`.
In `Main`, create `new Book("Clean Code")` and verify: `Book Title: Clean Code`.

